<section>

<div class="wrap">

<div class="sec-head">

<div>

<span class="sec-index">Index / 06</span>

<h2>Rental Tracking</h2>

</div>

</div>

<div class="checkout-card">

<div class="checkout-row">

<span class="stamp">Listed</span>

<h3>Item Published</h3>

<p>
Your item is now visible to verified students.
</p>

</div>

<div class="checkout-row">

<span class="stamp">Booked</span>

<h3>Item Picked Up</h3>

<p>
Pickup is confirmed using QR Code scanning between both users.
</p>

